{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "aaba10cc63109f5d50afb7edd4fa04eaf01ff5b6364d5f879c508d51afa78f84", "ja": "Noblesse ～仮面～", "zh": "Noblesse ～假面～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9ac41d30a1a7a8b8c0ef97f9c643189b2127cb9015623a3f9de99da49f810034", "ja": "新曲披露公演、当日。雪歩と千鶴にもう迷い\r\nはない。落ち着いたふたりの様子に、感心す\r\nる恵美と律子。やがて時間となり、積み重ね\r\nた勇気と想いを胸に、ふたりはステージへ！", "zh": "新曲披露公演当天，雪步和千鹤已经不再迷茫。看到两人镇定自若的样子，美惠和律子不禁佩服。时间终于到了，两人怀揣着积累至今的勇气与心意，走上了舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "12265ccf8c7af4f43926aa56d75bf8263002fe46f36b4ac6756a611828ea9015", "ja": "（今日はいよいよ、新曲披露公演当日！\nみんな、準備はできているだろうか……）", "zh": "（今天终于是新歌公演的当天了！大家都准备好了吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "c701cba42b92fe30a7bce0d83a9775bc50a9f7d1a09a6e6df16c78bb8b8273af", "ja": "あれ～？　ねね、アタシのタオル、誰か知らない？\nここに置いといたはずなんだけど。", "zh": "咦～？那个，有人看到我的毛巾了吗？\n我记得明明是放在这里的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "d9d6af368bd9d35a23120ff67973611736cba3c60e98e59022b02a3eff5e261d", "ja": "タオル？　\nそこの椅子に掛けてあるやつ、恵美のじゃないの？", "zh": "毛巾？\n挂在那边椅子上的那条，不是惠美的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "fddf663a1b26d756496c125b52d964ac83466ee2c030dee842d3b01a893e2112", "ja": "あ、これこれ！　ありがと、律子さん……って、\n今度はマスカラが見当たらないんだけど～！？", "zh": "啊，就是这个！谢谢你，律子姐……等等，\n这次又找不到睫毛膏了～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "8796a097342c1da8ca639e895279d2e3679c2a5be48390deeac023ecf78a8831", "ja": "それならさっき、このメイクボックスの\n中に入ってるのを見たわよ。", "zh": "要是那个的话，我刚才看到它在这个化妆盒里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "2c34a0c4bc29545cf4b003fb6587a3d5084bc7f244e5d4661c9ed61e3f75576f", "ja": "そうそう、これこれ～！\nちょっと直したいトコあってさ～。", "zh": "对对，就是这个～！\n我有个地方想稍微改一下～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "bb5fe3822a2c34e93b97718a3ae7e4a3e16247887bd39a09c9ced3f54c07ab9a", "ja": "今から？　もう、あんまり時間ないわよ。\n手伝うから、急いでやっちゃいましょ！", "zh": "现在才开始？真是的，已经没多少时间了。\n我来帮你，赶紧把它做完吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "f2f648414bb75217839a5be1e4f46ad2da609b6e6d90c1a8194acee247e76773", "ja": "ありがとー、律子さん！　へへっ♪", "zh": "谢谢你——律子！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1bf6f480a5b632c77cfb8d82618c6e5b1f27b8bbe13383a645fb8eb60f55f99c", "ja": "……何だか、恵美を中心にだいぶ\nバタバタしてるみたいですけど……大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "……总觉得，以惠美为中心那边好像\n闹腾得相当厉害……不要紧吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "ba8659a659e8b84ac3ee8b81a8b6f501986a0dbe6d480a03f13ff4eb22fdfd97", "ja": "ええ、まったくですわね。\n本番前だというのに、にぎやかすぎますわ。ふふっ！", "zh": "是啊，确实如此。\n明明马上就要正式演出了，却热闹过头了呢。呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7ce5ec96f4d9ec8dedc8d3ce927c01fe15e92545613823ac9d20e91f06c076dc", "ja": "ふふ、そうですね。けど、\nおかげであんまり緊張してない気がします。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。不过，多亏了这样，我好像没那么紧张了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "61a221c332e7a84581ebaae8ca706b19078811708e8b8dac4aaa2fd6705e3766", "ja": "あら雪歩、頼もしいこと言うじゃない。\n撮影の時とは、だいぶ違うみたいね？", "zh": "哎呀雪步，这话听起来挺可靠的嘛。\n跟拍摄的时候相比，好像大不一样了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d370d7bcbcb65a606945c6c94986c45422ac5806b63fdaac41451e3ee176a58d", "ja": "り、律子さん、からかわないでください……うぅ。", "zh": "律、律子小姐，请别笑话我了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "69aa799fcd287d846fa15b06184591f6211f532c2b3a4b01d102fad5583c5c7c", "ja": "でもホント、雪歩も千鶴も、なんか落ち着いてるよね。\n特訓とかした？", "zh": "不过说真的，雪步和千鹤都感觉挺沉稳的呢。是特训过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "3c69d96d05596e921e21012d91790187c5666774b5916335a4b6fe02fa9ff376", "ja": "何かと言われましても……いつもどおりですわ。\nねえ、雪歩ちゃん？", "zh": "要说原因的话……也和平时一样呢。\n对吧，雪步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "db11f9ecb82dc6d74aef9fc231a94cb8bec6c119abb7f4004348d7da6dd3b396", "ja": "はいっ！　きっとCM撮影や、その後のお仕事で、\n自信がついたんだと思います……えへへ。", "zh": "是！我想一定是因为拍了CM，还有之后的工作，让我更有自信了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e55f6063fed57af9666657148926ea65a0144132a38dd9743b6f594fc643e68c", "ja": "そうだな。\nこれもひとつの成長の形だな。", "zh": "是啊。\n这也是一种成长的表现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "1219c935bb090ca0ab2caa8de0c719d1eea03bf51cb2e9d4e34092641697f121", "ja": "うんうん。たしかに雪歩、がんばってたもんね！\n本番の撮影もバッチリだったし♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，确实，雪步一直都很努力呢！正式拍摄也完成得非常棒♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "79178e3031dd4d68aa08de0830c2d07248dcca1ee0ccb06c30eca788589baacf", "ja": "やっぱ、アタシの愛のムチが効いたのかなー？なんて。\nにゃはは♪", "zh": "果然还是我的爱的鞭策起效了吧～？开玩笑的啦。\n喵哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "7faeaf35217fb44fd5025da6d829389ae4c5e0c38eabdfe35e4243c5c1a267b2", "ja": "そうねえ。何だかケガの功名に近い気もするけど……\nま、でもいい方向に進んで何よりです！", "zh": "是啊……总觉得有点像因祸得福，不过能往好的方向发展就再好不过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5d1bfeddc1a34eb8f238aac40237995c9422625e0af477bce95d22a7e828935d", "ja": "話はこれくらいにしておいて……。\nみんな、そろそろ移動するぞ。", "zh": "话就说到这里吧……。\n大家，差不多该出发了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0025728ee05a784d242d845b08cad94c9f3cb2c0a6e66bc4b4b64a620edca683", "ja": "はいっ！（ええ！）", "zh": "好！（嗯！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "2df36b34dd6bcf9447ba44fd19651899046ba39c1d862a1ce50616abc6f726a3", "ja": "ええ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "35912debbe6bc43b4c586001c1600ef90aa94eed18a497d963c73c11131c38c1", "ja": "は～い♪", "zh": "是～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "27f6cdf49a4aaa183dd891940b3d6c77cdbe6f7ea723a121f9ee6503dac5fbad", "ja": "みんな～！　今日は来てくれてありがと～！\n楽しんでる～？", "zh": "大家～！今天谢谢你们能来～！\n玩得开心吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "d1c2f39dba3dd281b6408242d1e7c14d7f5209389727bb21ca1bf05160619c95", "ja": "公演は、始まったばかりですからね。この後も\nガンガン行きますから、ついてきてくださいね！", "zh": "演出才刚刚开始呢。接下来也会继续全力以赴，所以请跟上哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1027_null", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "6e08c1417ce13c94b39a600158ef4c4873d763691781775abb1af44a20a2fe59", "ja": "律子と恵美、バッチリ盛り上げてくれてるな。\n……ふたりとも、大丈夫か？", "zh": "律子和惠美把现场气氛炒得很热烈呢。\n……你们两个，还好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1029_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0c2b121d87578c912e44a859eaeec4477e3133f3edf231ebfd7d4dc7d66d26c9", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}。\n私なら、大丈夫です……！", "zh": "是！{$P$}先生。我没事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1030_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cb6e65de85655474fd169a0908b49f5fcd3661a5f1a73f5d7ef80857b5981d19", "ja": "新しい曲を、みんなに届けてきます。いつかステージの\n私が、本物の私になるかもしれないから……。", "zh": "我要去把新歌传达给大家了。因为总有一天，舞台上的\n我或许会成为真正的我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1031_038chz", "source_sha256": "8c353474a5839c957ef1016bf9e3bb1b7389403bb3ad007cc7c7efbd93953634", "ja": "わたくしも、曇りのない気持ちで\nステージに立つことができそうですわ。", "zh": "我也能毫无顾虑地\n登上舞台了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1032_038chz", "source_sha256": "ab6405dd1bc88683a4958898a18a52dddc43fda0d90689471e3aef33dd091eff", "ja": "この曲で、わたくしと雪歩ちゃんが持つ、\nイメージの殻を破る……。", "zh": "就用这首歌，打破我和雪步所拥有的形象外壳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1033_038chz", "source_sha256": "a754c0a4a7314a362d2adea8f0ed0178b4c6339a3747304e1ad2189e7ce1e315", "ja": "そんなふうに仮面を被ることも、悪くありませんわね？\n{$P$}。", "zh": "像这样戴上面具，也未尝不是件好事呢？{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1034_p", "source_sha256": "18c36e32a3fb466f959209802f2e967f33d3b6e69abe3d2e8ec5bfaf26308593", "ja": "ええ。まだ、誰も知らないふたりの姿を、\n見せてきてください！", "zh": "嗯。请去让大家看看，还没有人见过的你们两人的样子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1035_038chz", "source_sha256": "6450d0b1c5622cda6196e742b91c9686360815faf13afb3c3d522b1c7c5385e5", "ja": "ええ！\n……雪歩ちゃん、行きますわよ！", "zh": "好的！\n……雪步，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1036_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9402572d12b7c8227c57796202ef9b16dbc53b66127a32c6ea576a3862eb2243", "ja": "はい！　行ってきます、{$P$}。\nがんばりますから、見ていてくださいね！", "zh": "好的！我出发了，{$P$}。\n我会加油的，请看着我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_06_1037_p", "source_sha256": "3c9ff552323112746bdf60bfa5c1f91e7d6632fb454ff3de0cc5fcf513b674f0", "ja": "（勇気を奮い立たせ、想いを胸に秘め……\nアイドルは、そうして輝く）", "zh": "（鼓起勇气，将心意深藏于心……\n偶像，就是这样闪耀的）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
